      "SANDY: Hey ya’all, this is Sandra. Leave a message...or don’t.\nGERTI: Sandra, it’s me again. I don’t know what time it is. I still haven’t figured out the whole time difference thing. Maybe you’re asleep. Maybe…\nGERTI: Call me. Soon. I’m lonely. And this house is creepy. And send more magazines. I’ve read all mine. Especially any with Ryan Gosling.\nGERTI: I want to come home, Sandy."
